],"height_m":2.0,"name":"low_pgb"}},{"LowCeiling":{"center":[0.0,67.0],"half_extents":[15.0,21.0],"height_m":2.0,"name":"low_bc"}},{"LowCeiling":{"center":[24.5,59.0],"half_extents":[9.5,4.0],"height_m":2.0,"name":"low_pk"}},{"LowCeiling":{"center":[27.0,34.0],"half_extents":[17.0,2.0],"height_m":2.0,"name":"low_c1"}},{"LowCeiling":{"center":[42.0,-27.0],"half_extents":[2.0,63.0],"height_m":2.0,"name":"low_c2"}},{"LowCeiling":{"center":[27.0,-87.0],"half_extents":[17.0,3.0],"height_m":2.0,"name":"low_c3"}},{"Door":{"half_width_m":3.0,"height_m":2.0,"id":"door_warren","kind":"Locked","pos":[0.0,0.0,21.0],"yaw":0.0}},{"Door":{"half_width_m":3.200000047683716,"height_m":2.0,"id":"door_return","kind":"OneWay","pos":[14.0,0.0,-87.0],"yaw":1.5707963705062866}},{"Lever":{"id":"lever_warren","pos":[-3.5,0.0,16.399999618530273],"target":{"Door":"door_warren"},"yaw":0.0}},{"Lift":{"bottom_y":-18.0,"half_extents":[2.0,3.0],"id":"mossgut_lift","pos":[38.0,59.0],"top_y":0.0}},{"Lever":{"id":"lever_lift_top","pos":[35.0,0.0,60.599998474121094],"target":{"Lift":{"id":"mossgut_lift","stop":1}},"yaw":1.5707963705062866}},{"Lever":{"id":"lever_lift_bottom","pos":[41.0,-18.0,59.0],"target":{"Lift":{"id":"mossgut_lift","stop":0}},"yaw":-1.5707963705062866}},{"HollowWall":{"center":[-35.0,2.0,-35.0],"half_extents":[3.0,2.0,1.0],"id":"wall_nursery_closet","sturdy":false}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_moss_mouth","pos":[0.0,0.0,-88.0],"text":"Mossgut Cave. Spores drift in the light of the fungus, and the roof comes down to meet the floor. The way goes north."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_moss_gallery","pos":[0.0,0.0,-66.0],"text":"The roof is low here: a swing that rises over your head will strike the rock. Stab, or cut level, and keep the heavy blows for the open."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_moss_spore_hall","pos":[0.0,0.0,-40.0],"text":"The Spore Hall. Crawlers nest in the moss, and a Husk stands among the pillars. Nothing here can be fought from above."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_moss_branch","pos":[-20.0,0.0,-27.0],"text":"A side tunnel with a sweet, rotten smell. Whatever lives at its end has left a light burning."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_moss_closet","pos":[-35.0,0.0,-31.0],"text":"One wall of the nursery is thinner than the rest. A draught comes through it."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_moss_warren","pos":[0.0,0.0,-8.0],"text":"The Brood Warren. The gate to the north is shut, and a lever stands beside it across the room. The nests along the walls are very quiet."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_moss_lever","pos":[1.0,0.0,12.0],"text":"Pull the lever and the gate opens. Pull it once. The hollows in the walls open with it."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_moss_gate","pos":[0.0,0.0,38.0],"text":"The Gate Hall. Beyond the pillars, a mist hangs in the passage. The Mossgut Brood is at the heart of the cave, in a chamber too low to swing a heavy blade."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_moss_chamber","pos":[0.0,0.0,50.0],"text":"The Brood's chamber. A mother, grown into the wall, and sacs of eggs. East of the room, an alcove; past it, the lift."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_moss_shaft","pos":[33.0,0.0,59.0],"text":"The lift shaft. The doorway's lever sends the platform down eighteen meters, to the roots of Hollowdeep. Do not step off the edge."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_moss_shaft_bottom","pos":[45.0,-18.0,59.0],"text":"The shaft's floor. The lever by the platform calls it down, and sends it up. A cold light comes from the east."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_moss_return","pos":[14.0,0.0,34.0],"text":"A long dry corridor. It runs back to the cave's mouth, to a door that opens from this side only."}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"marsh_crawler","name":"crawler_gallery","patrol":[],"pos":[6.0,0.0,-56.0],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":3.1415927410125732}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"husk","name":"husk_spore","patrol":[],"pos":[0.0,0.0,-28.0],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":3.1415927410125732}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"marsh_crawler","name":"crawler_spore_a","patrol":[],"pos":[-11.0,0.0,-36.0],"wakes_on":null,"yaw":3.1415927410125732}},{"Enemy":{"enemy":"mar